# A bakery bakes the flours the castle sends it: the baker stands inside from the start, two flours lie on the castle's flag, a carrier takes
# them over the road to the bakery's flag and on into the bakery, the baker bakes each in a stretch and a pause, and the bread goes back to
# the castle. The script fast-forwards to the castle's first bread and takes a shot of the bakery and its road. Run it on the layout, under
# either graphics source:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh baker --layout layouts/baker.jsonc --fps 10
#   sh tools/play-run.sh baker --layout layouts/baker.jsonc --fps 10 --graphics open-settlers
wait 0.3
expect bread = 0
expect-at 13 10 baker
fast-forward until bread >= 1 max 30000
scroll up 6 860 560
wait 0.3
dump bread-stored
shot bread-stored
expect bread >= 1
